# Frontend & UI Guidelines

- **NO AI TELLS:** Avoid generic purple gradients, default Inter font, equal 3-card rows, and placeholder text like "John Doe" or "Seamless".
- **ACCESSIBILITY & CONTRAST:** Ensure WCAG AA contrast for text, buttons, and form controls.
- **LAYOUT & SPACING:** Avoid `h-screen`; use `min-h-[100dvh]` to prevent mobile jumping.
